4-13. A pace. ~ TROT
6-28. Not older. ~ YOUNGER
10-26. Used in Russian prisons. ~ KNOUT
14-22. The goddess of malicious mischief. ~ ATE
21-30. Space. ~ AREA
25-32. Humorous prevarications. ~ FIBS



